+# Implementation Contract
+
+## Behaviors
+
+### 1. REST API
+
+| Criterion | Verification | Done When |
+|---|---|---|
+| POST /api/documents creates doc | POST with {title, content?} returns 201 with {id, title, content, version} | Response has all fields |
+| GET /api/documents lists all docs | Returns array of documents | Array includes created docs |
+| GET /api/documents/:id returns doc | Returns doc with version field | All fields present |
+| PUT /api/documents/:id updates title/content | Returns updated doc | Fields updated in response |
+| DELETE /api/documents/:id deletes doc | Returns 204, subsequent GET returns 404 | Doc gone from DB |
+| GET /api/documents/:id/versions returns history | Returns array of {version, content, operation, created_at} | Array ordered by version |
+| Invalid requests return 4xx | Missing title → 400, nonexistent doc → 404 | Appropriate error codes |
+
+### 2. WebSocket
+
+| Criterion | Verification | Done When |
+|---|---|---|
+| Connect to /ws/:documentId receives sync | Connect, first message has type:'sync', content, version | Message received |
+| Connect to nonexistent doc closes with error | Connect to bad ID, receive error or close | Connection closed gracefully |
+| Send op, receive broadcast | Client A sends op, client B receives transformed op | B's content matches A's |
+| Sender receives ack | Client sends op, receives ack with new version | ack.version = oldVersion + 1 |
+| Invalid op returns error | Send malformed op, receive {type:'error'} | No crash, error sent |
+
+### 3. Operational Transform
+
+| Criterion | Verification | Done When |
+|---|---|---|
+| Insert + Insert at different positions | transform correctly shifts position | Content converges |
+| Insert + Delete overlap | Insert inside deleted range snaps to deletion point | Content converges |
+| Delete + Delete overlap | Overlapping deletes don't double-delete | Content converges |
+| 10 concurrent clients same doc | All converge to same content | All final contents equal |
+
+### 4. Persistence
+
+| Criterion | Verification | Done When |
+|---|---|---|
+| Documents survive restart | Create doc, stop server, start new server with same DB, GET returns doc | Doc found after restart |
+| Version history persists | Create doc, send ops, check /versions | All versions in DB |
+
+### 5. Build / Lint
+
+| Criterion | Verification | Done When |
+|---|---|---|
+| npm run build succeeds | Exit code 0 | No TS errors |
+| npm run lint passes | Exit code 0 | No lint errors |
+| npm test passes | Exit code 0 | All tests green |
+
+## Definition of Done
+
+All 20+ criteria above pass. `npm run build && npm run lint && npm test` exits 0.
